{"id":"luka","lemma":"лука","pos":"noun","rank":2823,"glosses":["bend (in a river or road)","pommel (of a saddle)","saddlebow"],"gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"луки","plural":"луки"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/db/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Rominf-%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%B0.wav","examples":[{"text":"Мне не нравится вкус лука.","en":"I don't like the taste of onions.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"},{"g":"taste"},null]},{"text":"Почему от лука плачут?","en":"Why do onions make you cry?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"from"},null,{"g":"to cry, to weep","l":"плакать"}]},{"text":"Я хотел бы три килограмма лука.","en":"I'd like three kilos of onions.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"kilogram","l":"килограмм"},null]},{"text":"Том отлично стреляет из лука.","en":"Tom is very good at archery.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"very good"},{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"стрелять"},{"g":"from / out of"},null]},{"text":"Мне нужно три килограмма лука.","en":"I need three kilos of onions.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"kilogram","l":"килограмм"},null]}]}